# Dive into the ground three times: crash, lose all lives, game over, back to the main menu.
# Exercises player death (the GPTR(0) segfault in PORTING_NOTES section 9).
description: crash three times, game over, return to the main menu
suite: quick
frames: 1400
expect: ever('status', 3)
expect: in_order(seq('lives'), [3, 2, 1, 0])
expect: ever('status', 5)
expect: last['menu'] == 0
expect: max(col('bits')) > 0
script:
300 304 DOWN
330 336 A
480 486 A
600 606 A
760 766 A
900 1300 A
950 1300 UP
